  journal   = "American economic review. Insights",
  publisher = "American Economic Association",
  abstract  = "We construct a new dataset to show that successful entrants in
               the consumer food sector build market share by adding new
               customers. Entrants reach new customers by entering more
               geographical markets, placing their product in more stores in
               these markets, and, for a positively selected subset of firms,
